'''Ronnie Burgess''' (March 7, 1963 – January 4, 2021) was an American professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[defensive back]] for the [[Green Bay Packers]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Wake Forest Demon Deacons football|Wake Forest Demon Deacons]].
